# CR 701.59a and the ruling: "If you can't exile enough cards to meet or exceed the required mana value, you can't choose to
# collect evidence at all." Bot1's graveyard is empty, so attempting that payment reverses the cast and its mana abilities.
# It is then cast without the additional cost; the Ornithopter dies and nothing is exiled. The positive control,
# the same option offered with enough mana value in the graveyard, is the all-three-zones scenario.

